{"id":"vod_md_5332","vodId":"5332","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"尼尔：自动人形 Ver1.1a","name_cn":"尼尔：自动人形 Ver1.1a","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230923-1/cacfc3e0054934f67128e4c5f985f02b.jpg"},"summary":"西历5012年。突然入侵地球的＜外星人＞与其制造的＜机械生物＞导致人类面临灭亡危机。仅存的人类逃至月球，为了夺回地球，利用＜人造人＞士兵展开反攻作战。然而无限增加的＜机械生物＞阻挡在前，战争陷入胶著状态。作为最终兵器，人类派遣新型人造人＜寄叶＞部队至地球。刚被派往地球的＜2B＞与先行调查员＜9S＞会合，一同执行任务，却在途中遇见许多神秘难解的现象……。这是关于为人类而战，无生命＜人造人＞的故事－－PS：Automata指的是“自动人形”，别再机械纪元求求了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动作,科幻,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-05 08:05:47","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/sp9gQ3ez/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/mM8u3XzD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/8cSsAjy4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/N6V8p5EG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/uz9MghrY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/7xROMic4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230926/ePmc1T64/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231003/NI4xCP3W/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/HMyGFQdt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/KtAOQYjt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/UiBZ32n7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231004/a510SaR2/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:53.661Z"}